{"title":"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/9/009cf3eeb0ff3789cc057632947cadb200ab4663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" /> represents the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/0007cf64122ba1e844325b328297bec07f97227b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle \\times \\triangle + \\triangle$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/5744cbb2c1ea56df43f8648d77ab3267478f2880.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/dee6ff6f8b21bb465e42fd53db5ff22e38441f31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 5 + 5 = 25 + 5 = \\boxed{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"201\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC\">2021 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20